Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.91,0:00:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These players who think it's\Nall about their agility,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.81,0:00:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,man, they're living in a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.49,0:00:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.63,0:00:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,firing speed and evasion are important,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.71,0:00:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and time was, if you rock those two\Nthings, it's all you needed to be the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.03,0:00:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till now, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.89,0:00:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, hate to say it, but it\Ndon't work like that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.31,0:00:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.22,0:00:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a message for\Nthe folks who spent the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.39,0:00:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,last eight months indoors\Nboosting their AGI.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.91,0:00:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sucks to be you right now, Tony.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.71,0:00:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's the kind of comment we'd expect\Nfrom the top player of Gun Game Online,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.75,0:01:02.22,MMOStream,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\pos(430.5,147)}XeXeeD
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.75,0:01:02.22,MMOStream,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\pos(949.5,147)}Yamikaze
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.75,0:01:02.22,MMOStream,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\pos(1470,174)}Host
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.09,0:00:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one of the most challenging VR Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.65,0:00:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about controversial.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.33,0:00:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess, but who knows if\NI'll be on MMO stream again,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.35,0:00:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so might as well stir things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.99,0:00:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.90,0:01:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, do you think you have a shot\Nin the upcoming bullet of bullets?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn right, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.25,0:01:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be in it if I\Ndidn't think I could win it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.95,0:01:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be that easy to succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.35,0:01:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The B .O .B.'s a solo journey,\Nso it's way different.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.59,0:01:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What worked for you up to now\Ndoesn't mean it'll work again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.79,0:01:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were you, I wouldn't chalk\Nmy wins up to my status type.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.43,0:01:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, if anything, my results point\Nto some big changes happening in G .G .O.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.41,0:01:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all about A.G.I., Yamikaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.53,0:01:28.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go figure you'd be in denial.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.71,0:01:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up, people! Till now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.29,0:01:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the best strategy was\Nboosting your AGI and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.49,0:01:36.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shooting a powerful gun\Nas fast as you could.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.97,0:01:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the reality is, the balance of\Ngameplay in an MMO is always changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.31,0:01:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially in games like this one,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.01,0:01:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with levels that don't let\Nyou respect your stats.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.83,0:01:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to think ahead and be\Nsmart when using your points,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.23,0:01:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because the best weapon in one level\Nzone might not work for you in the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.41,0:01:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.33,0:01:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the new guns coming out\Nare gonna have higher
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.33,0:01:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,strength requirements\Nand accuracy bonuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.39,0:02:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You remember when he was talking\Nabout how great being an AGI type was?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.81,0:02:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That dick totally scammed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.59,0:02:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a fake. Sex seed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.33,0:02:20.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, you'll face judgement\Nfrom someone with real power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.65,0:02:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I'm saying is, what's really important\Nin the end is the player's ability to...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.31,0:02:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, I guess we have\Na bad connection here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.23,0:02:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, folks, I'm\Nsure he'll be back shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.73,0:02:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay tuned for more MMO's dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.35,0:03:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is real power, real strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.27,0:03:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let your fear carve one\Nname into your brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.37,0:03:14.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name I share with\Nthis weapon, Death Gun.
