Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.85,0:03:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,December 7th, 2025.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.13,0:03:38.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has it already been a year?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.71,0:03:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what the difference is\Nbetween the real world and the virtual.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.59,0:03:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The amount of data, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.49,0:04:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.27,0:04:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.63,0:04:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on time, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.39,0:04:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.19,0:04:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.67,0:04:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was spacing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.71,0:04:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, hello, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.05,0:04:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you doing today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.57,0:04:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been good so far,\Nbut it's even better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.81,0:04:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you staring at? Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.61,0:04:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just, uh, that outfit looks good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.95,0:04:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It brings back a lot of memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.13,0:04:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.63,0:04:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No rapier, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.93,0:04:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you went\Noverboard on the black today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.45,0:04:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.36,0:04:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sugu threw everything in\Nthe wash this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.29,0:04:36.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this is all I had left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.19,0:04:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then stop putting your laundry off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.21,0:04:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we both dressed\Nin our old colors today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.59,0:04:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are the odds of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.29,0:04:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if we see each other\Nevery day for a year, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.47,0:04:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a rhetorical\Nquestion, Smarty Pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.87,0:04:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.78,0:04:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.87,0:05:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know about you, but I think\Nthe Imperial Palace is interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.89,0:05:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.80,0:05:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.37,0:05:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's two kilometers north to south,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.69,0:05:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,1.5 east to west, and it\Ntakes up 20 % of Chiyoda Ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.83,0:05:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There aren't any subways or tunnels\Nunder it, and it's a no-fly zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.89,0:05:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of cool, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.67,0:05:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's this big restricted\Narea right in the middle of Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only is it cut off from everything\Nphysically, but information-wise as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.11,0:05:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.02,0:05:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a surveillance camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.71,0:05:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place was set up with\Nits very own closed network.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.75,0:05:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't even access it from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.85,0:05:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's a weird-looking camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.55,0:05:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.49,0:05:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only is this place the heart of Tokyo,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.93,0:05:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's also an isolated\Nworld of its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.51,0:05:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm exaggerating its cool factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.89,0:05:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get like that. You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.27,0:05:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.03,0:05:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This used to be the inner citadel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.09,0:05:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.66,0:06:16.91,Stone,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\be0\xshad0\frz345.5\fax0.23\pos(789,426)\c&H020306&\4c&H020306&\t(40,1020,\blur1.5\c&H3E5081&\4c&H4D6CAE&)}Former Cannon Emplacement
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.37,0:06:20.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you know that questionnaire\Nthey gave us to fill out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.47,0:06:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one about our future plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.31,0:06:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know what you want to do yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.73,0:06:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.64,0:06:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess, if anything, I want to go from\Nplaying games to being a creator. A creator?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.73,0:06:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, for games?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.15,0:06:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not for games.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.67,0:06:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to make a human-machine interface\Nto replace the full-dive tech we use now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.79,0:06:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been going to all these tech\Nforums to learn more about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.67,0:06:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's a heck of a lot\Nof information to absorb.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.97,0:06:49.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After I graduate, all I\Nwant is to be with you. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.37,0:06:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I wish we could figure out a\Nway to live with Yui in this world, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.61,0:06:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be able to live with her someday,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.21,0:06:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as soon as we figure out how to\Naccess augmented reality at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.01,0:07:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing standing in the way is\Nthe difference in the amount of data.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.51,0:07:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say something\Nlike that a little while ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.25,0:07:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the difference between our world\Nand the virtual was the amount of data?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.37,0:07:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that mean, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.35,0:07:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.41,0:07:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.45,0:07:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we were holding hands in ALO,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.65,0:07:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it wouldn't be the same as\Nin the real world, would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.59,0:07:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.09,0:07:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can feel a lot more\Ntouching a real hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.61,0:07:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that what you mean by the\Ndifference in the amount of data?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.71,0:07:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.62,0:07:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And can you imagine\Nwhat it would be like if
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.35,0:07:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we could reproduce the\Nfeel of skin in a pulse?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.85,0:07:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would we be able to tell the difference\Nbetween a real hand and an avatar's hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.03,0:07:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I could, if I\Nwas touching your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.49,0:07:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's not just touch, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.53,0:07:45.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, in the real world,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.63,0:07:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we get a lot of information from\Nhow something sounds or tastes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.25,0:07:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if our atmosphere rigs\Ncould access augmented reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.39,0:07:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'd still know the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.87,0:07:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the second you saw or touched\Nsomething, you'd know if it was real or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.91,0:08:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But hopefully, someone will come along\Nand make a technological breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.25,0:08:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And whatever that is, it'll have to\Noutput a ton of sensory data all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.47,0:08:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we could break down the wall between\Nboth worlds and be with Yui forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.95,0:08:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think that day\Nwill ever come for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.27,0:08:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.18,0:08:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then get to work and make\Nit happen, okay? Okay?
