Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.67,0:08:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.77,0:08:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.69,0:08:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.43,0:08:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.51,0:08:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Order whatever you want. It's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.25,0:08:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.29,0:09:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's very kind of you. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.57,0:09:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be so formal with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.35,0:09:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax and talk to me\Nlike you would in ALO.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.49,0:09:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you say so, then I guess I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.45,0:09:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like the parfait au chocolate, the\Nframboise milfouille, and a hazelnut latte.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.73,0:09:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to make you come all\Nthe way out here, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.27,0:09:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're that sorry about it,\Nwhy'd you ask me to come to Ginza?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.69,0:09:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and do you think you cannot\Ncall me by that name in public?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.83,0:09:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with all the attitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.53,0:09:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we were buds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.53,0:09:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was the first to visit you\Nin the hospital, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.87,0:09:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.15,0:09:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I came to, the first\None there wasn't my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.39,0:09:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the leader of the task force.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.77,0:09:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seijiro Kikuoka,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.83,0:09:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from the Tech Bureau at the Ministry\Nof Internal Affairs and Communications,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.13,0:09:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a .k .a.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.04,0:09:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Virtual Reality Section.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.37,0:10:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what'd you want to see me about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.99,0:10:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's anything SAO-related,\NI told you everything I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.97,0:10:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I want to talk to\Nyou about something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.19,0:10:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.05,0:10:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.57,0:10:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This won't be pleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.63,0:10:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So last month, on November the 14th,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.31,0:10:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the landlord of an\Napartment complex in Nakano,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.19,0:10:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokyo, noticed a foul odor while cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.29,0:10:30.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was coming from one of the units.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.23,0:10:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he disabled the lock and\Ndiscovered this man, dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.73,0:10:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name was Tamotsu\NShigemura when he was 26.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.75,0:10:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd been dead for five days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.91,0:10:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They found him in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.39,0:10:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His place was a mess,\Nbut no signs of burglary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.51,0:10:45.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had something interesting\Non his head, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.93,0:10:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An Amusphere? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.49,0:10:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was ruled an unnatural\Ndeath, so they did an autopsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.77,0:10:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cause of death was found\Nto be acute heart failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.01,0:10:56.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, heart failure?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.65,0:10:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean his heart stopped?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.49,0:10:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They find out why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.11,0:11:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, they didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.07,0:11:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you are, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.97,0:11:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.88,0:11:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since so much time had\Npassed since his death
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.81,0:11:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and foul play was ruled out as the cause,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.09,0:11:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the autopsy wasn't very thorough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.93,0:11:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do know he'd been\Nlogged in for two days
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.09,0:11:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,straight and hadn't eaten\Nanything the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.41,0:11:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's not that unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.25,0:11:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Players do it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.09,0:11:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, why are you telling me about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had a game installed on his\Nsystem called Gun Gale Online.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.25,0:11:31.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, GGO.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.83,0:11:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only MMO in Japan\Nwith professional players.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.47,0:11:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This past October, there was a tournament\Nto decide the most powerful player in GGO.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.23,0:11:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The deceased was the guy who won it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.69,0:11:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His character's name was Zexceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.33,0:11:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was he playing GGO when he died? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.73,0:11:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it happened, he was appearing on a\Nshow called MMO Stream as Zekseed's avatar.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:48.95,0:11:54.42,MMOStream,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\pos(430.5,147)\shad0\c&HDAD6CE&}XeXeeD
Dialogue: 1,0:11:48.95,0:11:54.42,MMOStream,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\pos(949.5,147)\shad0\c&HDAD6CE&}Yamikaze
Dialogue: 1,0:11:48.95,0:11:54.42,MMOStream,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\pos(1470,174)\shad0\c&HDAD6CE&}Host
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.35,0:11:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know the time from the logs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.03,0:11:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This next bit of info still\Nneeds to be confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.41,0:12:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to another player's blog,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.41,0:12:07.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at the same time Shigemura had the heart\Nattack, something strange happened in GGO.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.51,0:12:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.42,0:12:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some players were at a bar\Nin-game watching the show when
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.05,0:12:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one of the players stood up\Nand started acting erratically.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.33,0:12:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blog states,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.81,0:12:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The player was shouting stuff\Nabout judgment and power
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.43,0:12:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at Zexeed's image on the TV\Nand then fired his gun at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.35,0:12:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the time, another player in the\Nbar happened to be recording audio.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.15,0:12:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He uploaded it to a video site.
Dialogue: 3,0:12:27.57,0:12:39.46,Android,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1441,0)\c&H6E6166&\blur1.2\frz11.33\pos(518.142,114)}Sound recording at Glocken Bar during Zexceed's logout
