Dialogue: 2,0:12:27.57,0:12:39.46,Android,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1441,0)\c&HF3F7DE&\fs24\blur1.2\pos(1107,979.5)\frz13.35}I happened to record it so I decided to upload it. Sound only.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:27.57,0:12:39.46,Android,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1441,0)\c&HE2F2EC&\fs24\blur1.2\pos(1108.5,981)\frz13.35}I happened to record it so I decided to upload it. Sound only.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.73,0:12:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since the file had a Japan\NStandard Time counter embedded.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.03,0:12:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know that the shot fired at the TV and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.19,0:12:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shigemura's avatar\Ndisappearing from the show?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.41,0:12:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,happened at about the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.89,0:12:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably just coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.81,0:12:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was another death, though. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.89,0:12:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one happened on November the\N28th, somewhere in Saitama Prefecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.23,0:12:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same setup as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.79,0:12:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The deceased was found in their apartment.
