Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.85,0:12:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A guy delivering the newspaper\Nhappened to look in the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.47,0:12:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He saw the victim lying in\Nbed wearing an AmuSphere rig.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.89,0:13:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Said the smell was...
