Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.35,0:13:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's skip the details of\Nthe corpse's condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.17,0:13:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, heart failure\Nwas the cause of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.03,0:13:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The victim was also a\Ntop-ranking GGO player.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.03,0:13:15.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His character's name was Usushio Tarako?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.29,0:13:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he was playing when he died.
