Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.47,0:13:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A strange player went up to\Nhim and shot him, point-blank.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.03,0:13:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know if it was the\Nsame guy who shot Zexceed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.51,0:13:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.77,0:13:36.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said stuff about judgment and power,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.07,0:13:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then identified himself\Nwith the same character name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.05,0:13:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What name?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.37,0:13:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.29,0:13:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death Gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.49,0:13:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you absolutely sure both\Nvictims died from heart failure?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.47,0:13:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.43,0:14:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was there any damage to their brains?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.93,0:14:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wondering about that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.13,0:14:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I asked the coroner if he found any\Ntrace of damage to either of their brains,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.17,0:14:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he said they were both fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.11,0:14:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, the NerveGear rig\Nused high-output microwaves,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.15,0:14:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,powerful enough to fry the signal\Nelements and destroy the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.35,0:14:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the other hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.43,0:14:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Amusphere rig was designed so that it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.23,0:14:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,couldn't emit electromagnetic\Nwaves that powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.91,0:14:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least, that's what\Nthe developers claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.53,0:14:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounds like you guys\Nhave done your homework,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.29,0:14:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but even so, your story's built\Naround coincidence and rumors. True.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.69,0:14:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could be a coincidence or even a hoax.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.97,0:14:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sold either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.17,0:14:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, and this is\Nhypothetical, mind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.07,0:14:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think it's even remotely\Npossible to stop a player's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.69,0:14:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,heart in the real world with\Nvirtual bullets from a virtual gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.97,0:15:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.93,0:15:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But hypothetically,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.79,0:15:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's say this death gun\Ndid send some kind of killer
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.59,0:15:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,signal to Zekseed and that\NTarako guy's ammospheres.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.61,0:15:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.03,0:15:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could the sensation of\Na touch stop a heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.95,0:15:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe a taste or smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.21,0:15:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sight, a sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.87,0:15:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or some other sensation?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.41,0:15:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.79,0:15:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You already thought of this, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.09,0:15:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.51,0:15:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and your team can't figure it out, so\Nyou invite me for coffee to pick my brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.17,0:15:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.77,0:15:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd never do something\Nlike that to you, honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.13,0:15:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I liked talking to you and\Njust wanted your opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.99,0:15:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.21,0:15:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want my opinion?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.41,0:15:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.32,0:15:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't stop a player's heart in\Nthe real world by actions in-game.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.85,0:15:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shots fired and the heart\Nattacks are coincidences.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.23,0:15:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.14,0:15:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, you can order something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.75,0:15:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just sit down and hang out for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.29,0:16:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.20,0:16:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you how relieved I\Nam to hear you put it into words.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.97,0:16:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fact is, I'm of the same opinion as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.49,0:16:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe these two deaths were\Ncaused by in-game gunshots either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.99,0:16:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now that we've talked, I\Nwant to ask you officially.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.95,0:16:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you log into Gun\NGale Online and make
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.63,0:16:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,contact with the player\Ncalling himself Death Gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.13,0:16:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once I do find the guy, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.95,0:16:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to get shot, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.85,0:16:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa now, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.15,0:16:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, screw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.06,0:16:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to get killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.27,0:16:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.65,0:16:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just agreed it wasn't, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.25,0:16:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, this Death Gun guy is\Nonly going after specific targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.61,0:16:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have to meet his criteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.49,0:16:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Criteria? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.07,0:16:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.55,0:16:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zexceed and Usushio Tarako\Nweren't just any old players.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.45,0:16:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were top-ranked, so it's safe to\Nassume he's not interested in newbies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.27,0:16:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you were strong enough to\Nbeat Kayaba at his own game, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.81,0:16:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's different!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.72,0:16:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't know what you've\Nheard, but GGO's no walk in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.89,0:16:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's filled with pro gamers!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.33,0:16:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold the phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.24,0:16:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said pro gamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.31,0:17:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that mean, pro?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.83,0:17:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means professional. Literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.83,0:17:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gungale Online is the only\Nvirtual MMO with a game
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.79,0:17:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Control currency\Nconversion system in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.89,0:17:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.80,0:17:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means whatever money you earn in\Nthe game gets paid back to you in cold,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.27,0:17:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hard cash in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.17,0:17:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being a pro means you\Nhave a constant stream
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.31,0:17:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of income from the game\Ncoming in every month.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.69,0:17:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you're a top player, that means\Nmonthly you're making $200,000 to $300,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.01,0:17:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an awesome gig.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.53,0:17:30.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why the high-level\NGGO players are so hardcore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.87,0:17:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They pour more time and passion into\Nit than players from other Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.39,0:17:38.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone like me can't just log\Nin and match players like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.61,0:17:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should find someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.93,0:17:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hold it, hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.93,0:17:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who else am I going to find?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.11,0:17:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.02,0:17:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need your help in this investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.49,0:17:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and if taking these pros on is going to be\Nthat big a deal, I can pay you this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.39,0:17:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get why you're so hung up on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.73,0:17:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You find horror stories like\Nthese all the time online.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.39,0:17:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.73,0:18:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, it's got my bosses worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.17,0:18:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The effect of full-dive technology on the\Nreal world is the hottest topic today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.93,0:18:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Literally everyone's researching it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.15,0:18:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People are going to try to use these\Ndeaths to regulate the technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.75,0:18:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We want to know the facts\Nbefore that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.49,0:18:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We want to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.65,0:18:18.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why we're interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.33,0:18:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys could just go directly\Nto the admins about it. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.51,0:18:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Zaskar, the company that developed\Nand hosts GGO, is in the U .S.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.97,0:18:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their address, phone number, and email?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.15,0:18:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of it's been made public,\Nso we can't contact them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.91,0:18:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since the seed was released, all kinds\Nof shady VR worlds have popped up. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.09,0:18:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're legit, maybe they're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.21,0:18:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we want to find anything out,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.15,0:18:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only way to do it is to try\Ncontacting them in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.37,0:18:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not asking you to get shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.31,0:18:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take whatever safety\Nprecautions we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.13,0:18:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just evaluate the\Nsituation and report back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.19,0:18:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So will you help us or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.77,0:19:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,4,000 people died in Aincrad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.69,0:19:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a year and finally those\Nmemories are starting to fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.83,0:19:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now, more people are dying\Nin another virtual world,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.41,0:19:15.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm getting pulled back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.25,0:19:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like someone doesn't\Nwant me to ever forget.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.07,0:19:23.57,Stone,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\be0\xshad0\frz345.5\fax0.23\pos(789,426)\c&H020306&\4c&H020306&\t(40,1030,\blur1.5\c&H26304F&\4c&H4F6DA8&)}Former Cannon Emplacement
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.39,0:19:26.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.09,0:19:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I figured out why\Nyou brought me here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.15,0:19:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you did, huh? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.29,0:19:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If our world is made up of an axis\Ncalled time and a plane called space,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.91,0:19:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then the center of our reality is\Nthis place, in the heart of Tokyo,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.19,0:19:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where a castle used to stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.59,0:19:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the axis of all the\Nvirtual worlds popping up now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.51,0:19:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thanks to the Seed, is a place that\Nalso had a castle once, Aincrad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.13,0:19:54.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why this sunset\Nfeels so nostalgic now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.29,0:19:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.57,0:19:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It does.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.13,0:20:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, what you just said helped\Nme figure something out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.51,0:20:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.91,0:20:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You remember what Aincrad\Nlooked like? Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.91,0:20:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe its shape was supposed to represent\Nthe axis of time and the plane of space.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.79,0:20:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.70,0:20:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if its vertical axis represented\Ntime and its floor is space,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.75,0:20:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then the Commander made a\Nworld that tapered to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.43,0:20:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything ended once you reached the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.03,0:20:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, a certain\Nsomeone destroyed it halfway up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.21,0:20:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we'll never know how it ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.41,0:20:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.47,0:20:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.19,0:20:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna, listen, I... What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.61,0:20:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.53,0:20:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's getting cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.81,0:20:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to start heading back now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.23,0:20:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.14,0:20:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and next time we come, let's\Nbring Liz and Leafa and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.91,0:20:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be fun to get everyone\Ntogether for a picnic here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.89,0:20:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it would.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.07,0:20:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially in springtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.55,0:21:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in position. Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.69,0:21:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Targets haven't changed\Ntheir course or their speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.93,0:21:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're 400 meters from you, 1500 from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.65,0:21:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty far.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.81,0:21:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you make the shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.27,0:21:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No sweat. Okay, then. Fire when ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.83,0:21:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Sinon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.45,0:21:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.43,0:21:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This pressure, this anxiety, this fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.39,0:21:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,1500 meters that's nothing like tossing a
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.63,0:21:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lot of paper into a trash can no way
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.71,0:21:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is nothing like how it felt that day
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.23,0:22:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.90,0:22:07.74,OP-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Without a second thought, right now
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.90,0:22:07.74,OP-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k30\fad(200,200)}May{\k27}owa{\k26}zu {\k12}ni {\k22}i{\k167}ma
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.74,0:22:11.74,OP-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Take aim at this paradox-ridden world
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.74,0:22:11.74,OP-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k20\fad(200,200)}Mu{\k39}jun {\k17}da{\k20}ra{\k19}ke {\k76}no {\k80}se{\k71}kai {\k59}wo
