Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.77,0:22:31.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.39,0:22:39.23,OP-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}So why do we keep hurting each other
